r my post-graduation plans.", "response": "{\n    \"sentiment_score\": 0.8,\n    \"emotion_tags\": [\"excited\", \"connected\", \"hopeful\", \"anxious\", \"curious\"]\n}", "metadata": {"assistant_id": "asst_u2Yzgp43eGV0y9Qrvjip2KXP", "thread_id": "thread_v5FlQ5HphiB2exDIsCfpmbY4", "used_tools": false}}
