rom what I'm used to. As I prepare for bed, a mixture of excitement and nervousness dominates my thoughts. Tomorrow represents the true beginning of this academic journey\u2014the real reason I've traveled thousands of miles from home. I'm setting my alarm early to ensure a calm morning routine before facing whatever challenges the day brings.", "response": "{\n  \"sentiment_score\": 0.8,\n  \"emotion_tags\": [\"hopeful\", \"excited\", \"relieved\", \"productive\", \"anxious\"]\n}", "metadata": {"assistant_id": "asst_UKxqezjD5h4stYERa01T81Sf", "thread_id": "thread_l3gX9OjzPgB6jKzbqIXSFAAi", "used_tools": false}}
